title: "IRIS: Intelligent Road Inspection System"

type: software

authors:
  - family-names: Arya
    given-names: Adarsh
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0003-3703-460X"

abstract: >
  IRIS (Intelligent Road Inspection System) is an AI-powered
  road infrastructure monitoring platform that performs
  real-time pothole detection, severity classification,
  GPS-based localization, municipal review workflows,
  and intelligent road inspection using deep learning
  and computer vision.

version: "v1.0.0"

date-released: 2026-06-26

